<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50067" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">văcŭē
			-făcĭo</span></b> , fēci, factum,
			3, v. a.
		vacuus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to make empty; to empty</i>, <i>clear</i>, <i>free.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b> (rare but class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quid quod adventu tuo ista subsellia vacuefacta
					sunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Cat. 1, 7, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">domum novis nuptiis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 6, 14</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Scyrum vacuefecit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Nep.
					Cim. 2, 5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id.
				Timol. 3, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fasces securibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Max. 4, 1, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">turpi sentinā exercitus vacuefactus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
					7, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">venas inedia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 7, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">locum alicui in cenā,</span>”
				<i>to clear a place</i>, <i>make room</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 2</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circumcisiones,</span>”
				i. e. <i>to abolish</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Lact. 4, 17, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
